s going to be  more common to require vaccines than to  not require vaccines within the next few  weeks  [Applause]  and while some people may challenge  those mandates don't expect a judge to  overturn them says cbs news legal  analyst ricky clement historically  mandates work according to the law that  is a government a business  a university can demand that people get  vaccinated there were many people who  felt that it did not have full approval  and therefore it was risky to get it  that argument goes right out the door  because with full approval  it is therefore looked at as a safe  vaccine  so the full approval applies to those 16  and older full approval for the younger  kids experts say probably won't come  until the fall and at the end of the day  the fda says when you look at all the  clinical data and the clinical trial  data  the coven 19 vaccine from pfizer is 91  effective at preventing covet 19 disease  gail  david thank you
 

